<span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    processBatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>防护策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>将 CPU 密集型任务分解为小批次，用 <code>setImmediate</code> 让出事件循环</li>\n<li>使用 <code>worker_threads</code> 将计算任务分配到独立线程</li>\n<li>避免使用同步版本的 I/O API（如 <code>fs.readFileSync</code>）</li>\n<li>监控事件循环延迟，设置告警阈值</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Node.js 采用分层架构：应用层 → 核心库 → V8 + libuv + 其他 C/C++ 库。</li>\n<li>单线程事件驱动模型是 Node.js 的核心特征，适合 I/O 密集型场景。</li>\n<li>事件循环由六个阶段组成：Timers → Pending → Idle → Poll → Check → Close。</li>\n<li>微任务（nextTick、Promise）在每个阶段之间被优先清空。</li>\n<li>避免阻塞事件循环是 Node.js 编程的第一原则。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Node.js 架构与事件循环","id":"node-js-架构与事件循环"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Node.js 整体架构","id":"node-js-整体架构"},{"level":2,"text":"单线程与事件驱动模型","id":"单线程与事件驱动模型"},{"level":2,"text":"事件循环的六个阶段","id":"事件循环的六个阶段"},{"level":3,"text":"各阶段详解","id":"各阶段详解"},{"level":3,"text":"执行顺序验证","id":"执行顺序验证"},{"level":2,"text":"微任务与宏任务","id":"微任务与宏任务"},{"level":2,"text":"setTimeout 与 setImmediate 的竞态","id":"settimeout-与-setimmediate-的竞态"},{"level":2,"text":"事件循环阻塞与防护","id":"事件循环阻塞与防护"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"ti